===== path p list cursor
List Cursor (IDE) composers (global, newest first). Reads `<user-data>/User/globalStorage/state.vscdb`

Usage: path p list cursor [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -p, --project <PROJECT>
          Filter by workspace folder path (absolute). Matches by canonical equality against each composer's `workspaceIdentifier.uri.fsPath`

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (default: pretty when stdout is a TTY, tsv when piped)

