===== path p list pi
List Pi (pi.dev) projects or sessions

Usage: path p list pi [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -p, --project <PROJECT>
          Project path — if omitted, lists all projects (pretty) or all sessions across all projects (tsv/json)

      --base <BASE>
          Override the Pi sessions base directory (default: ~/.pi/agent/sessions)

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (default: pretty when stdout is a TTY, tsv when piped)

          Possible values:
          - pretty: Human-readable, with section headers and aligned columns
          - json:   One JSON object per call
          - tsv:    One session per line, tab-delimited. See README for column layout

      --json
          Output as JSON (deprecated alias for --format json)

